file crates/gui/src/graph/build.rs
symbol header
lines 56 92
hash 7f9adab8be5120d3
note Where the buttons come from: callees are the symbol's own callees, not only the names inside the node's shown lines, and callers are the symbol's callers. Each button shows the count still hidden, or 'hide n' once revealed, and is left out when every one is already a node. While the node's file waits for its language server the header says 'waiting for <server>' and does not claim the node calls nothing. Otherwise an empty callee list says 'calls not in this repo' when the symbol has call names or targets the index could not place, and 'calls nothing' when it has neither. An empty caller list says 'no callers in this repo'.

